# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Termnova — Environment Configuration Template
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Database (PostgreSQL + pgvector) ──
# Local default port: 5432, Docker default port: 5433
DB_USER=aditya
DB_PASSWORD=
DB_NAME=termnova
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://aditya@localhost:5432/termnova
DATABASE_URL_SYNC=postgresql://aditya@localhost:5432/termnova

# ── Redis Cache & Session Store ──
# Local default port: 6379, Docker default port: 6380
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

# ── LLM Provider Configuration (opencode | openrouter | openai | bedrock | ollama | mock) ──
LLM_PROVIDER=opencode
OPENCODE_API_KEY=your-opencode-go-key-here
OPENCODE_BASE_URL=https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1
LLM_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash

# OpenRouter key is shared by LLM fallback and embedding requests.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-openrouter-key-here
OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here
LLM_FALLBACK_PROVIDER=openrouter
LLM_FALLBACK_MODEL=deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash
LLM_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30
LLM_NUM_RETRIES=2

# ── Embeddings ──
EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=openrouter
EMBEDDING_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3-embed-1b:free
EMBEDDING_DIMENSION=2048

# ── RAG Pipeline Parameters ──
CHUNK_SIZE=512
CHUNK_OVERLAP=64
MIN_CHUNK_SIZE=50
TOP_K_RETRIEVAL=10
RELEVANCE_THRESHOLD=0.3
BM25_K1=1.5
BM25_B=0.75
RRF_K=60

# ── Application Runtime ──
APP_ENV=development
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
UPLOAD_DIR=data/uploads
MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE_MB=50
CORS_ORIGINS=["*"]

# Required for production. Generate at least 32 random characters and store it
# only in your deployment secret manager; never ship it to browser JavaScript.
REQUIRE_AUTH=false
# API_KEY=
BROWSER_SESSION_TTL_SECONDS=28800

# Expose metrics only on an authenticated/private network endpoint.
EXPOSE_METRICS=false
